<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 bln mark-into-euro 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 bln mark-into-euro 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT ** 1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    15.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.325</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    97.90     SPREAD	+9 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING GUILDER, FRENCH FRANC AND</p>
<p>		ESCUDO EURO BONDS</p>
<p>	    **REDENOMINATED INTO EUROS AFTER THIRD STAGE OF EMU</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  PAYDATE    S08.APR.97</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.425     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRSTCOUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
